      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;Two of Sam&apos;s friends live in the forest: a robin with her cheerful song and a shy fawn with his brown eyes. But his very best friend is a gnome who lives where the leaves are thick, and ferns and mosses grow. They often leave special gifts for each other - a beautiful feather, a golden leaf, or an empty snail shell. One day, after a very windy night, Sam finds a torn piece of red cloth snagged on a thorn. It&apos;s from his best friend&apos;s cap! So, Sam runs home to sew a very special gift for his best friend&quot;-Amazon.com.</marc:subfield>
